you just add the oil as you need it can use peanut oil which is perfectly good you want to be sure

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:28.690
with your oil that you don't use any that when it gets hot it has a bad odor olive oil is a light

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:29.810
olive oil is often good

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.500
The peanut oil is good too.

