If you wanted to saute them until they were cooked through,

00:18:20.690 --> 00:18:22.840
it would take about five or six minutes.

00:18:23.020 --> 00:18:26.740
And this, we're just sauteing them a little bit so that they'll take on flavor.

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:29.970
They always have, if you put them right into the stew...

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:34.830
raw they just wouldn't have the right taste so we just have to sit and wait

