you put more than this in they'd start steaming and then the juice would come

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:59.260
out and a properly so sauteed mushroom doesn't have any juice there those are

00:18:59.260 --> 00:18:59.860
just very

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:13.040
very lightly brown and we can now set them aside there you see these you can do ahead of time so

